{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farming just got a whole lot weirder!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber pigs, mutated crops, and a lot of laughs \u2014 welcome to \ud83e\udd16<strong>Cyber Farmer</strong>\ud83e\udd16, a wacky, post-apocalyptic farming simulator where tradition meets the future! Step into the boots of Kazimierz\u2019s grandson, the next in line to inherit the family farm. Set in a world devastated by war, Cyber Farmer blends rustic village charm with outlandish cyber tech, all while cranking up the humor to the max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your post-apocalyptic farm\u2622\ufe0f, where cyber tech\ud83e\udd16, genetically modified crops\ud83c\udf3e, and cyber pigs\ud83d\udc37 are just part of everyday life. Prepare for a game full of laughs, bizarre surprises, and quirky farming fun as you build your very own cyber farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 Use high-tech cyber gadgets to improve your farm: Harness the power of futuristic gadgets to take your farming to the next level. From robotic tools to cybernetic upgrades, tech is at the heart of your farming revolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/ae73445bf70584b193cda2769e45c418.poster.avif?t=1773310424\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/ae73445bf70584b193cda2769e45c418.webm?t=1773310424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/ae73445bf70584b193cda2769e45c418.mp4?t=1773310424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude02 Hilarious gameplay with strange and funny moments: With tons of absurd moments, unexpected events, and quirky characters, Cyber Farmer is full of humor and fun. Expect plenty of laughs as you navigate through this bizarre farm life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/4358cf66448c236fe49691894b86ef51.poster.avif?t=1773310424\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/4358cf66448c236fe49691894b86ef51.webm?t=1773310424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/4358cf66448c236fe49691894b86ef51.mp4?t=1773310424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Post-apocalyptic world with humor and surprises: Discover a world torn apart by war, where the remnants of the old life mix with futuristic technology. Every corner hides bizarre surprises and quirky characters ready to keep you laughing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/87762dcbbb068570d5c28d35259641b9.poster.avif?t=1773310424\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/87762dcbbb068570d5c28d35259641b9.webm?t=1773310424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/87762dcbbb068570d5c28d35259641b9.mp4?t=1773310424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Grow genetically modified crops and experiment with plant mutations: Explore a farming experience like no other! Modify your plants, experiment with strange mutations, and use cyber-enhancements to boost your crops to extraordinary levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/246c3a6ac7a0b73e26a30150bf9022c1.poster.avif?t=1773310424\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/246c3a6ac7a0b73e26a30150bf9022c1.webm?t=1773310424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/246c3a6ac7a0b73e26a30150bf9022c1.mp4?t=1773310424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc37 Raise cyber pigs and other unusual animals: On this farm, animals aren\u2019t just animals\u2014they\u2019re part of the future! Grow, modify, and raise cyber pigs and other mutated creatures to help you in your daily farming tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9c Continue the farming legacy of Kazimierz\u2019s grandson: As the heir to the family farm, you must keep the tradition alive, but with a twist! Combine the wisdom of the old farm with futuristic innovations to build the ultimate cyber farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/746cba211273fa9d670dd1fffad68431.poster.avif?t=1773310424\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/746cba211273fa9d670dd1fffad68431.webm?t=1773310424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/extras/746cba211273fa9d670dd1fffad68431.mp4?t=1773310424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farm the future, laugh through the past!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3461890?t=1773310424","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/9e363c1d1f5d507e12a79a932cac9464a9a1123f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773310424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/6e7b3c1730c1462433b174a920ea1b096556a64e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773310424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461890/6e7b3c1730c1462433b174a920ea1b096556a64e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773310424","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3739800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farming just got a whole lot weirder!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyber pigs, mutated crops, and a lot of laughs \u2014 welcome to \ud83e\udd16<strong>Cyber Farmer</strong>\ud83e\udd16, a wacky, post-apocalyptic farming simulator where tradition meets the future! Step into the boots of Kazimierz\u2019s grandson, the next in line to inherit the family farm. Set in a world devastated by war, Cyber Farmer blends rustic village charm with outlandish cyber tech, all while cranking up the humor to the max.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your post-apocalyptic farm\u2622\ufe0f, where cyber tech\ud83e\udd16, genetically modified crops\ud83c\udf3e, and cyber pigs\ud83d\udc37 are just part of everyday life. Prepare for a game full of laughs, bizarre surprises,